ustle","hit":0.06},{"at":[0.71,0.91],"fx":"sparkle","sound":"chime","with":"sorry"}]},{"id":"vine","eyebrow":"Part Five","title":"Jonah’s Plant","verses":["4:1","4:11"],"beats":["But Jonah was angry. He didn’t want God to forgive his enemies! So he sat outside the city to sulk in the hot sun.","So God made a leafy plant grow up over Jonah to give him shade. Jonah was very happy about the plant.","But the next morning, God sent a little worm to chew the plant, and it withered away. Jonah was angry all over again.","God said, “You cared about one little plant. Shouldn’t I care about a great city full of people?” God loves everyone, even the people we find hardest to love."],"layers":[{"id":"hill","kind":"plate","depth":0.1,"paint":"hill","src":"art/jonah/vine/hill.jpg"},{"id":"plant","kind":"plate","depth":0.1,"from":1,"paint":"plant","trigger":"tap","hint":"Tap the ground","origin":[0.62,0.78],"sfx":"grow","src":"art/jonah/vine/plant.jpg","editModel":"kontext"},{"id":"withered","kind":"plate","depth":0.1,"from":2,"paint":"withered","src":"art/jonah/vine/withered.jpg","editModel":"kontext"}],"effects":[{"type":"motes","from":0},{"type":"sprout","with":"plant","ground":0.72}],"touch":{"hint":"Tap the ground to plant","at":[0.7,0.85]},"sound":{"ambience":["wind","crickets"],"mood":"warm"},"frame":[0.68,0.5],"stickers":[{"id":"plant","name":"The Shady Plant","earn":"reveal","layer":"plant","at":[0.71,0.25],"r":0.12},{"id":"grumpy","name":"Grumpy Jonah","earn":"play","layer":"hill","at":[0.72,0.55],"r":0.09},{"id":"worm","name":"The Little Worm","earn":"secret","layer":"withered","with":"withered","at":[0.63,0.14],"r":0.04,"hit":0.05}],"lamb":{"at":[0.8,0.58],"size":0.03,"flip":true,"until":"plant"},"spots":[{"at":[0.18,0.21],"fx":"twinkle","sound":"twinkle","hit":0.06,"size":1.6},{"at":[0.65,0.2],"fx":"leaves","sound":"rustle","hit":0.08,"with":"plant","until":"withered"}]}],"talk":{"questions":["Why do you think Jonah ran away from God?","Jonah didn’t want God to forgive his enemies. Is it hard to forgive someone who was unkind to you?","God loves everyone. Who could you show God’s love to this week?"],"verse":{"ref":"Jonah 2:9","text":"Salvation is from the LORD!"}}}